// result_end
\caption(Ninety-six visible Adam updates on fresh per-epoch Gaussian corruption. Validation uses fixed corruption and saved moving BN;the selected checkpoint restores both learned and running state.)
\alttext(Ninety-six visible Adam updates on fresh per-epoch Gaussian corruption. Validation uses fixed corruption and saved moving BN;the selected checkpoint restores both learned and running state.)


\image(figures/dncnn_metrics.svg)
\caption(All32 held-out natural images compare learned,noisy-input and fixed reflected-mean estimates. Raw and clipped PSNR remain separate;no baseline is selected or fitted using test targets.)
\alttext(Held-out raw and clipped PSNR for a learned residual denoiser and two fixed references.)

\image(figures/dncnn_predictions.png)
\caption(All32 actual held-out images,two five-panel tiles per row. Each tile shows noisy,reflected box,learned,clean,and four-times red absolute learned error. Inputs/outputs are clipped only in this display.)
\alttext(Actual noisy CIFAR grayscale photographs,their fixed and learned reconstructions,clean targets and visible errors.)

The short fit reduces training-mode probe half-MSE from .287240 to .005109,
but moving-BN probe error rises from .004734 to .005051. Its held-out raw
PSNR19.826817dB is below the untouched noisy input’s20.219740dB and the
fixed mean filter’s24.034324dB. Clipped scores preserve this ordering.
This run demonstrates optimization and state handling;it does not demonstrate
a denoising-quality gain. Training-mode improvement alone would miss that.

The compact width reduces channels,not the number of layers. The short fit
checks optimization and deployment under a known synthetic noise level on
natural images. It does not establish Train400/BSD68 quality,blind denoising
or parity with published/pretrained weights. Error galleries and fixed
references show what is recovered and what is smoothed or missed.

> Conclusion

Signed residual derivatives,source-seeded corruption and independent reflected-filter/BN checks establish the mechanism. Visible optimization then fits all17 layers on natural images with fresh noise. Paired-state deployment is immutable and noisy-input-only;raw/clipped metrics and actual held-out errors limit the claims to this short teaching experiment.

> References

- [Zhang et al.(2017),Beyond a Gaussian Denoiser:Residual Learning of Deep CNN for Image Denoising](https://arxiv.org/abs/1608.03981).
- [Author DnCNN training implementation](https://github.com/cszn/DnCNN/blob/master/TrainingCodes/dncnn_pytorch/main_train.py).
